# Commands that wipe a Supabase database, for databaseResetCommands: one a line, as
# setup reads them. From the Supabase CLI's docs for 3.0.0, checked on 2026-11-06.
# A command matches when it starts with all of a line's words.
supabase db reset
npx supabase db reset
supabase migration down
npx supabase migration down
supabase stop --no-backup
npx supabase stop --no-backup
supabase stack destroy
npx supabase stack destroy
